        "nobel_worthiness": "Their theoretical framework made trapped ions a compelling route to quantum computation and controllable many-body physics.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller supplied the central theoretical proposals connecting atomic control to gates and simulation.",
        "maturity": "The ideas have been extensively realized and have shaped a broad experimental field.",
