        "attribution": "These researchers made key theoretical and experimental contributions; the appropriate allocation of priority across the field needs close scrutiny.",
        "maturity": "Neutral-atom arrays have progressed from clean demonstrations to powerful, reproducible many-body experiments.",
        "uncertainties": ["Mikhail D. Lukin is also an important contributor and the discovery-to-platform boundary is not sharp."]
      }
